//    v                                                          v
// +-----------+ <-----\       +-----------+ <------\         +-----------+
// |  [null]   |        \----- |   next    |         \------- |   next    |
// +-----------+               +-----------+                  +-----------+
// |   item    | <-- bottom    |   item    | <-- bottom       | undefined |
// |   item    |               |   item    |                  | undefined |
// |   item    |               |   item    |                  | undefined |
// |   item    |               |   item    |                  | undefined |
// |   item    |               |   item    |       bottom --> |   item    |
// |   item    |               |   item    |                  |   item    |
// |    ...    |               |    ...    |                  |    ...    |
// |   item    |               |   item    |                  |   item    |
// |   item    |               |   item    |                  |   item    |
// | undefined | <-- top       |   item    |                  |   item    |
// | undefined |               |   item    |                  |   item    |
// | undefined |               | undefined | <-- top  top --> | undefined |
// +-----------+               +-----------+                  +-----------+
//
