//    v     v                                     v     v
// +-----------+                               +-----------+
// |  [null]   |                               |  [null]   |
// +-----------+                               +-----------+
// | undefined |                               |   item    |
// | undefined |                               |   item    |
// |   item    | <-- bottom            top --> | undefined |
// |   item    |                               | undefined |
// | undefined | <-- top            bottom --> |   item    |
// | undefined |                               |   item    |
// +-----------+                               +-----------+
